<title>USA: TB Wood's sees Q1 net ahead of Q4.</title>
<headline>TB Wood's sees Q1 net ahead of Q4.</headline>
<dateline>CHAMBERSBURG, Pa. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>TB Wood's Corp said Friday it expects net income for the first quarter to exceed the $1.8 million reported for the 1996 fourth quarter.</p>
<p>The company, which makes transmission products, said it sees revenues for the first quarter, ended April 4, up more than 10 percent from the fourth quarter's $27.7 million.</p>
<p>First-quarter revenues will likely be up 25 percent from the year-ago first quarter, it said.</p>
</text>
